> Master Bedroom--Imagine[ waking] up to looking out over the water!
This never gets old.....another gorgeous[ sunset]!
Beach:[ Beach] and sand flats are about 40 feet away.
LOCATION: Enjoy your stay on this beautiful[ pond] located in[ West] T[isbury] on the[ gorgeous] island of[ Martha]'s Vineyard. T[isbury] Great[ Pond] is an exceptional, private, quiet[ sanctuary] away from everything. It is where the surf rolls in across the landscape. The[ pond] offers an abundance of activities and places to explore. When the ''cut'' is open, it is the absolute best. The beach offers numerous sand flats for the young ones to play on, the water is extremely warm and shallow, but also has deep places to swim. Then there is[ surfing] available on the ocean side. When the ''cut'' is open, you can[ ride] in or out depending on which[ way] the[ tide] is going......It is magical!! This is the place to[ reconnect] with nature and be totally at peace. While everything else to make your Vineyard[ vacation] wonderful is not far away, when you are here, you are far, far away in your own, off-the-grid world.
Drive down approximately 3 miles on a dirt road, and this will lead you to the house. The house sits on a 3.5 acre[ parcel] on the west side of Middle Point and overlooks Th[umb] and Deep Bottom Coves. The immediate area is a globally-rare, sand plain, containing grassland and heath which extends out to the barrier beach and the ocean.
The property includes a beach and swimming area on the[ Pond], where one can pull up and store canoes,[ kay]aks, sail[boats], (Sun[fish], Laser are available). A[ canoe] is available for exploring the[ pond] and[ padd]ling to the barrier beach. To further enhance your stay, sail[boats] and[ kay]aks can be[ rented] from Winds Up on the[ Beach Road] in Vineyard Haven.
THE HOUSE: The house has (4) four[ bedrooms] and (1) full bath. Each of the four[ bedrooms] can accommodate 2 people. Bedroom #1 has a double bed,[ bedroom] #2 has a double bed,[ bedroom] #3 has twin[ beds], and[ bedroom] #4 has twin[ beds]. But these[ bedrooms] are unlike anything you have ever seen! Everything is built in, and the overall effect is as if you were on a ship. The twin[ beds] are not one on top of another, but rather they are[ perpendicular] to each other, aff[ording] each person their own privacy and space.

=== Text #10 ===
> A great "B[udget]" FT scope as well as being a pretty handy HFT and longer range hunter.
>>> Top Grade A Microlux ETE emerald lens coatings developed for low light use, plus you see the target faster,[ clearer] and with more[ contrast].
[>>> Adjustments] are Target style, to adjust simply pull out gently and[ turn] to the desired[ setting]. Push down[ again] to lock.
[Gen]uine[ Nik]ko product from UK importer NOT a cheap clone copy such as many of those sold by Far East sellers.
An excellent very large lens size which gathers a lot of light combined with the 30mm[ tube].
ETE premium Multi-coated to protect and limit[ glare] and reflections (looks) the business too.
Adjust anywhere from 10x to 50x.
Please[ note] that as magnification increases you will find the view gets a little paler/[mil]ky. This is just a[ consequence] of high magnification on what is essentially still a mid level budget very high power scope. It can be avoided by spending 2-3x as much on the Diamond 10-50 or Hawke ED!
Glass-etched reticles are[ way] superior to wire for several reasons, most notable is how much more crisp, fine and clean your view is when you look[ thorough] the scope - beautiful it is!
A glass etched reticle, also cannot be broken. Anyone who has[ shot] enough has seen a wire reticle actually break within the reticle field. As the reticle design is etched into the reticle[ lens], it is static and cannot physically be broken.
[Ill]um[ination] comes into its own when shooting targets that are either naturally dark or made dark by light conditions such as shadow,[ dawn dusk], very bright light or night shooting with[ lamps] or night vision[ kit].
Without[ Illumination] a black reticle can be very hard to make out against the target.[ Illumination fixes] this problem and gives immediate[ contrast].[ Adjust] intensity according to the light conditions.
